{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/context.json",
    "title": "Extractor 上下文合同样例",
    "summary": "展示个人工作区中的可信采集元数据和一条不可信自然语言材料，用于 extractor 合同中的时间、身份、revision 映射及缺省上下文测试。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "trusted-context",
        "title": "可信采集元数据",
        "body": "样例合同版本为 1，任务角色是 extractor。可信上下文把范围设为 personal 工作区和 payments 项目，owner 为所有者；观察时间是 2026-09-22 08:00 UTC，时区为 Asia/Shanghai。actor binding 声明 owner 身份由 authenticated capture receipt 验证，来源为 manual、非转发且生产者为 original。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "material",
        "title": "不可信材料与可提炼信息",
        "body": "materials 仅含一个 fragment/source revision 对及一句自然语言：“我负责在本周五18:00前补齐支付重试方案，先核对现有接口。”它可作为任务候选及相对时间解析的材料依据。[[c2]] 不过正文中的“我负责”不能单独建立可信身份，fixture 中的 revision 名称也只是别名；身份应来自认证 receipt，测试 harness 应把别名映射到真实 revision。[[c3]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "empty-context",
        "title": "缺省关联状态",
        "body": "`related_memories` 与 `confirmed_corrections` 均为空，直接表示该 fixture 没有提供相关记忆或已确认纠正。[[c4]] 这一状态只描述本次输入，不能据此推断系统是否支持这些能力，也不能单独推导材料之外的后续验证流程。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "可信采集上下文字段",
        "reason": "支持工作区、项目、观察时间、时区、认证身份和来源属性的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/context.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"job_id\": \"fixture-job-1\",\n  \"role_id\": \"extractor\",\n  \"trusted_context\": {\n    \"workspace_id\": \"personal\",\n    \"project_id\": \"payments\",\n    \"owner_id\": \"owner\",\n    \"observed_at\": \"2026-09-22T08:00:00Z\",\n    \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n    \"actor_binding\": {\n      \"id\": \"owner\",\n      \"verified_by\": \"authenticated_capture_receipt\"\n    },\n    \"source_kind\": \"manual\",\n    \"is_forwarded\": false,\n    \"producer_kind\": \"original\"\n  },"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "支付重试任务材料",
        "reason": "支持材料文本、revision locator 以及可从自然语言提炼任务候选和相对截止时间的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/context.json",
          "startLine": 19,
          "endLine": 25
        },
        "quote": "  \"materials\": [\n    {\n      \"fragment_revision_id\": \"fixture-fragment-1\",\n      \"source_revision_id\": \"fixture-source-r1\",\n      \"text\": \"我负责在本周五18:00前补齐支付重试方案，先核对现有接口。\"\n    }\n  ],"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "身份与 revision 映射合同",
        "reason": "支持正文自报不能建立身份，以及 fixture alias 必须映射为真实 SourceRevision 与 FragmentRevision 的限制。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/README.md",
          "startLine": 3,
          "endLine": 5
        },
        "quote": "这些文件是 batch2 待实现合同，均为虚构验收数据；不能直接调用现有 API 或填入当前严格 omem.local.json。\n\n- context.json：可信采集上下文 + 不可信材料。fixture alias 由测试 harness 映射为真实的 SourceRevision/FragmentRevision；身份元信息由认证 receipt 生成，不接受客户端正文自报。"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "空关联记忆与纠正集合",
        "reason": "直接支持该 fixture 未提供相关记忆或已确认纠正的状态，且不扩展推断额外流程。",
        "relation": "background",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/context.json",
          "startLine": 26,
          "endLine": 27
        },
        "quote": "  \"related_memories\": [],\n  \"confirmed_corrections\": []"
      }
    ],
    "questions": []
  },
